# Set P review-pair key — ESCROWED. Do not open until your calls are recorded
# (export review-responses.js from review.html?set=P first).

- pair: p01
  L: N1_pdmd4_null_B2  R: A3_pdmd4_B2_med
  contrast: NULL GATE: the PDMD render duplicated through a fresh VAE-name alias
  expected: expected TIE — bit-identity proven at run time (framemd5+audio md5); the instrument's own calibration pair

- pair: p02
  L: A3_pdmd4_B1_low  R: A1_turbo8_B1_low
  contrast: PRIMARY: PDMD-4 vs turbo-8 — ball, slow short roll (rich board prompt)
  expected: the displacement question at this board cell

